    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the captivating world of anime with our new game, where your task is to find differences in 50 unique illustrations. Each image is crafted in anime style and features charismatic and attractive boys, designed especially for fans of the genre! Test your attentiveness and enjoy the colorful artwork!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 beautiful and detailed images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From 3 to 10 differences on each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for true lovers of anime aesthetics!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to challenge your skills and discover the magic of anime? Start playing today!</p>",
